This product includes modified copies of files from herdr-app
(https://github.com/herdrdev/herdr-app), licensed under the Apache License 2.0:
- herdr-app/layouts/supervisor.json: a clone of defaults/layouts/main.json (herdr-app 0.1.16),
  with a right-hand "watch" column (workers bar + pinned worker terminal), a projects block,
  the agents block switched to agent-folders and the status block switched to status-plus.
- herdr-app/mods/status-plus/main.js: a clone of the workspace-status mod (herdr-app 0.1.16),
  with Claude/Codex usage bars, a refresh button and History/Skills buttons added, and the
  layout reordered (usage on the left).

herdr-app/mods/agent-folders comes from kiote/pi-setup (MIT) and itself modifies herdr-app
files (Apache-2.0); its own NOTICE and license files are kept in that folder. In this copy the
Windows taskbar badge (hc-badge) section is removed.

The .svg icons are Lucide icons (ISC License, some MIT from Feather); see LICENSE-Lucide.txt.
